presented not misleading. The accompanying unaudited condensed consolidated financial statements have been prepared using the same accounting
policies as used in the preparation of the Company&#8217;s consolidated financial statements for the year ended December 31, 2025. The
results of operations for the six months ended June 30, 2026 are not necessarily indicative of the results for the full year.</p>

