major financial institutions located in the PRC and overseas, which management considers to be of high credit quality. To manage credit
risks with respect to accounts receivable and other receivables, the Company performs ongoing credit evaluations of customers&#8217; and
suppliers&#8217; financial condition. There is no significant credit risk for the six months ended June 30, 2025 and 2026.</p>

